    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 137,
        "text": "Okay, everyone, thanks for coming to the digitisation review meeting. We need to decide what we recommend for the old town archive.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "e3aaa92cdd0c61cf49081eb7740fa63459b8993284f8b340586d0d1ddd3f1741",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 144,
        "sourceEnd": 251,
        "text": "Right. The archive has about twelve thousand photographs, and most of them are from the 1950s to the 1980s.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "afbba6b3e2d62ab80222d12cc58b197c2626d6e2500013fac71d50c53cec4efb",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 259,
        "sourceEnd": 338,
        "text": "And the question is whether we should digitise all of them or only a selection.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6b07e615ad10d9054036ac95c8b2c58ac1a4c0404d0bb0a0ffcad7eb11c0b157",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 345,
        "sourceEnd": 432,
        "text": "I think we should digitise everything, because the physical photos are getting damaged.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "7b27bf1865f5dccd78206a143065eeeff173b1de0649e431b2948b9815045b0f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 440,
        "sourceEnd": 586,
        "text": "Wait, Ben, I agree that damage is a problem, but digitising everything would cost a lot. The estimate from the company was forty thousand dollars.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ed1f04f7f1d93d92f59b6d932ee4618aeb9999bb7aff7e37fed8514efe7633e1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 593,
        "sourceEnd": 633,
        "text": "Forty thousand? I thought it was twenty.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "70af1e5c2b0fb4be8ed617a41035079fb3becce3609f7b59f257a14972df4a51",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 641,
        "sourceEnd": 771,
        "text": "No, the written quote says forty thousand for the full collection. For a selection of three thousand photos, it's twelve thousand.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "71c830a761d6548bc9178f380b18709adf54aa0c0e142803a331835bff842d2f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 779,
        "sourceEnd": 878,
        "text": "So the full collection is more than three times the cost of the selection. That's a big difference.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "1cf9c3874015c314b7a934e40b07b7da92da9445d5711c77af780d41d556ca5e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 885,
        "sourceEnd": 968,
        "text": "Okay, I accept that. But if we only digitise a selection, who chooses which photos?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "0b7f0d6bf09e299f79d5b34705290cb66e0956d30071adf61fb326358c580517",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 976,
        "sourceEnd": 1105,
        "text": "That's the difficult part. The archivist, Mrs. Chen, said she could choose, but she also said it would take her about six months.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f6ba7aaceecb56fc91cfcbb075d8efeae06e4d05afddbe6cd4130f54fb950f0a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1113,
        "sourceEnd": 1180,
        "text": "Six months is a long time. And she's retiring next year, isn't she?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "6df8165a874211fd1784f1e81fb4d4fc1ffeef8de80ae34f906f0afccf4793d9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 1188,
        "sourceEnd": 1301,
        "text": "Yes, she retires in March. So if she does the selection, we might lose her knowledge before the work is finished.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a1a60a05c93704ef2e6091f22c48e29489ac1d2c25104146cd2c8b85a85ec071",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1308,
        "sourceEnd": 1379,
        "text": "That's a real risk. What if we digitise everything but do it in stages?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "76d16a738eaec71b9eddd1bf93ba49d9a563a1874bed30baabc14fd785f02d82",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1387,
        "sourceEnd": 1454,
        "text": "That's possible. We could start with the most fragile photos first.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "4a5093def922f657df610b1f04ec31816872f71a110ef40e6f4ee47de95eeba1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 1462,
        "sourceEnd": 1521,
        "text": "I like that. The fragile ones are mostly in boxes 14 to 22.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b67925f142c2df00af3927a4f8b692456ea9175d66a5d3e627538d04ca4cd142",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1528,
        "sourceEnd": 1605,
        "text": "And the cost? If we do it in stages, we could spread the cost over two years.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "31892632cb65ac36acf68b3ad6dc705178b1bc02bf410d894818b303ac9c359e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1613,
        "sourceEnd": 1706,
        "text": "The company said they could do that, but they would charge five percent more for staged work.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "2696914f111220f9f0c6061f44a0805f613d0265e8cfeb71d6d08e8a652401c1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 1714,
        "sourceEnd": 1820,
        "text": "Five percent on forty thousand is two thousand extra. That seems acceptable if it protects the collection.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "752814500f093615f8655f6c1defd6fefa860a79d327981566fce9c713b86bed",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1827,
        "sourceEnd": 1879,
        "text": "So are we recommending the staged full digitisation?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "97cddb2a86bc3f7c2e5bceaf05ea7529f2b78f6f7793f5f0cc343bcce41d2083",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1887,
        "sourceEnd": 2018,
        "text": "Let's be careful. We can recommend it, but we should also say that the final decision depends on the town council's budget in June.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "dcf7d579c4ca6d674bffd2b6890490e0b6b36e150829d77f9fc9ffb546cb0dad",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 2026,
        "sourceEnd": 2119,
        "text": "Agreed. And we should ask Mrs. Chen to write a short note about which boxes are most fragile.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "06d90a9015793737896d9ee967f5db4f9bfb3b082f4608840170b478eaad6702",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2126,
        "sourceEnd": 2148,
        "text": "I'll ask her tomorrow.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a5cee793ad053e8b405c87bcb675469eab57e63d6978fd55d19e7db679193f7b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2156,
        "sourceEnd": 2333,
        "text": "Good. So the recommendation is: staged digitisation of the full collection, starting with the fragile boxes, with a note from Mrs. Chen, and a final check on the budget in June.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "35e18cd215fbf0c31b30cb3041a92a32f355630f58b19944c3114cad698800c2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "lena",
        "speaker": "Lena",
        "sourceStart": 2341,
        "sourceEnd": 2460,
        "text": "That's right. And we should mention that the selection option is cheaper but riskier because of Mrs. Chen's retirement.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1a3afc66d3f6c4d45af51f0ef739fe8b27b5b852b119f9d45dacb1b2a0d4bb84",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2467,
        "sourceEnd": 2534,
        "text": "Okay. I'll write the first draft and send it to you both by Friday.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e9a89be4c8b5c2739cc18667706b2a0fa91f94f542ac949bdea02a3234c0205b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2542,
        "sourceEnd": 2568,
        "text": "Perfect. Thanks, everyone.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7ed98370278d14064e66ff076ca79aa1190bb5ce3a10364b5f86b73f351f505a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
